- `src/hono-base.ts` (fetched same way) — the `#dispatch()` outer `try { ... } catch (err) { return this.#handleError(err, c) }`, the "Context is not finalized" throw, `#handleError`, the duplicated try/catch in the single-handler fast path, and the default `errorHandler` function with the `'getResponse' in err` check.
- `src/http-exception.ts` (fetched via `gh api`) — confirms `HTTPException extends Error` and its `getResponse()` method, matching the duck-typed check in the default error handler.

