- I didn't check `context.ts` for the exact definition/semantics of `context.finalized` and `context.error`, only inferred their role from usage in `compose.ts`/`hono-base.ts`.
- I didn't check whether individual bundled middlewares (e.g. `src/middleware/*`) throw plain `Error`, `HTTPException`, or something else — this answer covers the core propagation mechanism, not every middleware's specific error behavior.
